  "legacy_defects": [
    "the desktop app serves every git workspace route: desktop_policy.install_routes filters route paths for '/git/', but FastAPI 0.141.1 registers the included git router as one _IncludedRouter entry with no path, which the filter keeps (docket the-desktop-app-still-serves-the-git-workspace-r)"
  ],
  "scope": "Legacy boundary of the git workspace routes (P01 F8) on disposable SQLite and disposable git repositories, against REAL git confined by the coordinator's ruling (decision 1 on p01-f8-contracts-for-the-git-workspace-routes-21): only git, with its cwd inside the test's temp root and an isolated configuration (no system config, a global config inside the root with no credential helper and an empty hooks directory, HOME inside the root), may launch, and every launch is recorded; remotes are local bare repositories inside the root. Legacy conformance evidence only: not a runtime census, not PostgreSQL or Rust qualification."
}
